Package: rathole
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: lightweight and stable reverse tunnel for NAT traversal
 rathole exposes services running behind NAT or firewalls through a
 server with a public IP, with one binary acting as client or server.
 Transports include TCP, TLS, Noise and WebSocket; configuration is
 a small TOML file (examples included).
